-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  suite_cli_host_linux_editor.adam - `adam editor` on a Linux host (LX7a,
  LX7b): the editor runs on the debugger (its Run goes through adam dap),
  which this host lacks (the linux editor and debugger come in a later
  release), so the command is CL0033 (not an unknown command), exit 2
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind cli
  targets x86_64-linux-gnu
  args "editor"
  exitcode 2
  | Error CL0033: 'editor' is not available on this host: this adam has no debugger for x86_64-linux-gnu programs
@@end
*/

module exe suite_cli_host_linux_editor;

begin
end.
